  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "The Checkout Attachment Module for eCommerceGo introduces a streamlined way for customers to add attachments during the checkout process. This module empowers customers to include essential documents or files related to their orders, such as design specifications, proof of identity, or personalized instructions. By allowing attachments at checkout, the module enhances the clarity and accuracy of orders, ensuring that all necessary information is captured upfront.": "eCommerceGo için Ödeme Eki Modülü, müşterilerin ödeme işlemi sırasında ek eklemeleri için kolaylaştırılmış bir yol sunar. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Canlı Demoyu Görüntüle",
  "Intuitive Attachment Process for Customers": "Müşteriler için Sezgisel Ekleme Süreci",
  "Designed with user experience in mind, the Checkout Attachment Module makes adding attachments a straightforward and hassle-free process. During checkout, customers are presented with an easy-to-use interface to upload their files. Supported file types and size limits can be configured to suit your business needs, ensuring compatibility and efficiency. This user-friendly approach helps reduce friction in the checkout process, leading to higher customer satisfaction and fewer order discrepancies.": "Kullanıcı deneyimi göz önünde bulundurularak tasarlanan Ödeme Eki Modülü, ek eklemeyi basit ve sorunsuz bir süreç haline getirir. ",
  "Enhanced Communication with Administrators": "Yöneticilerle Gelişmiş İletişim",
  "Once a customer adds an attachment, it becomes immediately visible to the admin on the backend. This feature is particularly useful for businesses that require additional documentation to process orders accurately. Admins can easily access, review, and manage these attachments through the eCommerceGo admin panel. This seamless integration ensures that all relevant information is at the admin fingertips, facilitating smoother order processing and better customer service.": "Müşteri bir ek eklediğinde, bu ek arka uçta yönetici tarafından hemen görünür hale gelir. ",
  "Customer Transparency and Access": "Müşteri Şeffaflığı ve Erişimi",
